From 95a1f012493ab42d44607bc33911fa57aeac3917 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charles Hoskinson <charles.hoskinson@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:06:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] T7: FP-2 statement AIR, slice plan_d in ENC-5, chip set
 1, anchor_d2 seam

- sherlock-lfr stmt: StmtAir (Leaf, First, Node, Fv, Root) with key_root and keys_d routes,
  the SEG merge and log merge, X10 header opening and R operands in L, PermSponge on the
  recursion permute bus, RootOpsAir; Rust reference and unit tests.
- iface: anchor_d2(r_L, prog_d) at the ANCHOR_D2 seam; IfaceAir skip for the root words.
- lverify: gen_ops_check ties the L operand words to the R entry inputs.
- sherlock-leaf: slice plan_d in the T9 ENC-5 form, chip set 1 (ExtAir), program B.
- t7_probe: key equality probes and the unary node probe.
