+//! T7 probes (no gate): key equality across chip sets and child layers, and a unary node.
+//!   t7_probe keys OUT    keys of app A/B, leaf, N1, N2, N3 and an `L`-shaped verifier over N3
+//!                        and over the leaf layer; pre-hashes compared
